  "description": "Eastman Omega 2000VA/24V Pure Sine Wave Inverter is engineered as a high‑performance backup solution for homes, offices, shops and even institutions like schools and clinics. The 2000VA/24V rating with pure sine wave technology ensures clean, stable power that can safely run sensitive electronics such as LED TVs, laptops, Wi‑Fi routers and desktop computers, alongside refrigerators, coolers and lighting loads. Thanks to high charge acceptance and robust transformer design, the inverter maintains one of the highest full‑load output voltages in its class, which helps appliances start reliably and extends their service life.The Omega series integrates a microcontroller‑based platform with multiple protection layers, including zero‑cross transition for smooth switching, a built‑in temperature guard to prevent overheating, two‑step boost charging for faster yet controlled battery charging, and rapid “in‑a‑wink” changeover that keeps devices running with minimal interruption when mains fail. Universal battery compatibility lets users pair the inverter with tubular, SMF or flat‑plate batteries of 150Ah and above in a 24V bank, making upgrades or replacements straightforward. Backed by a 36‑month product warranty and an impressive 10‑year transformer warranty, plus a compact 29 x 30.4 x 15.7 cm footprint, Eastman Omega 2000VA/24V offers a reliable, space‑efficient and long‑lasting power backup for modern Indian homes and workplaces.",
